    <string name="capacity_how">This tablet can\'t measure its battery\'s capacity directly. It estimates it from the charge cycles it counts and the battery\'s age.</string>
    <string name="capacity_setup_body">This tablet can\'t measure its battery\'s capacity directly, so it estimates it from the charge cycles it counts and the battery\'s age. Tell it when the battery was new to see the estimate.</string>
